# The watchdog's drone catching you (game/drone.h: drone_sees): booted on foot, out onto the entry
# as city.steps goes, then its run south over the street onto the next block (column 0, row 6, 60
# lower), when the run carries you that far (it doesn't always: the entry's edge is in its fan
# too). The drone waits up over the street at rows 6-7, its beam angled down at the roofs, the scan
# line sweeping out across them, the roofs it crosses lit cyan. Turned right to face it, shots each
# second from ~17 s to ~31 s. While the line's under you it's red, and its sensor white
wait_up
keydown up
wait 8.5
keyup up
hold l 2.2
wait 0.3
keydown up
wait 1.8
keyup up
wait 0.5
hold left 0.7
wait 0.5
hold down 1.5
wait 0.3
keydown up
wait 1.9
keyup up
wait 0.3
hold right 0.4
wait 0.3
shot ds_00_landed
wait 1.0
shot ds_01
wait 1.0
shot ds_02
wait 1.0
shot ds_03
wait 1.0
shot ds_04
wait 1.0
shot ds_05
wait 1.0
shot ds_06
wait 1.0
shot ds_07
